  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wadadli Action Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution will support the Wadadli Action Platform conference, to be held in Antigua and Barbuda from 8 to 9 August 2022. The objective of the conference is to transform ambition and commitment for SIDS under relevant international frameworks into urgent and concrete actions. The conference will build momentum for the next international blueprint for SIDS, which will take place in the context of the 4th UN international Conference for SIDS in 2024. 

The Wadadli Action Platform will seek to build alliance among SIDS, developed partners, the private sector and civil society to clearly articulate key priorities for SIDS for the 4th Conference. It will also provide short, medium, and long-term possible solutions to SIDS based on the negative impact of the COVID-19 pandemic, economic and climate crisis</narrative>
  </description>
